@startuml
title Merchant Catalog Management — Sequence DRAFT
actor Merchant
participant "Merchant Back Office" as BackOffice
participant "Ordering System" as System
participant "Catalog" as Catalog

Merchant -> BackOffice: Sign in
Merchant -> BackOffice: Create or edit own item and options
BackOffice -> System: Submit item details
System -> Catalog: Save item
Catalog --> System: Saved item
System --> BackOffice: Show item result

Merchant -> BackOffice: Take down or relist own item
BackOffice -> System: Change listing state
System -> Catalog: Update listing state
Catalog --> System: Updated item
System --> BackOffice: Show updated state

Merchant -> BackOffice: Manage own categories
BackOffice -> System: Add, edit or delete category
System -> Catalog: Apply category change
Catalog --> System: Category result
System --> BackOffice: Show result

Merchant -> BackOffice: Permanently delete own item
BackOffice -> System: Request permanent deletion
System -> Catalog: Delete item
Catalog --> System: Deletion result
System --> BackOffice: Show result

note over Merchant,Catalog
  Requirements: FR-02, FR-06–FR-11, FR-28, FR-32
  Existing order contents remain preserved under FR-28.
  Deletion while pending suborders reference deducted stock remains Unconfirmed (F-16).
end note
@enduml
